ollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Follow Purple Sugar</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following Purple Sugar</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fpurple-sugar.itch.io%2Fwitchs-bound&amp;intent=add_to_collection\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://purple-sugar.itch.io/witchs-bound/devlog\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/3207047/witchs-bound\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_eb-garamond\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI2ODI1OTM1LnBuZw==/original/VelOXu.png\" alt=\"Witch’s Bound\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Witch’s Bound</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\" id=\"view_game_7291478\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows, macOS, Linux, and Android</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://purple-sugar.itch.io/witchs-bound/purchase\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h2 class=\"text-center\"><strong>Antagonist? I’ll wear the title proudly if it means I get to call you mine. After all, you made me this way.&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">✦✦✦<br></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">I don’t have faith, but I’d kneel for you.&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">✦✦<br></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\"><strong>I&#x27;m fine. I always am. Just... don’t go too far, okay?&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">✦<br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><strong>Cooks like a lover and teases like a liar. You didn’t ask for him.\r\n</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><strong>But somehow, everything in the house feels like it already belongs to him, including you.&nbsp;\r\n</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><strong>Sometimes, the past echoes in strange ways.\r\n</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><strong>And when you think you’re alone, you’ll realize your fate is already crowded and has been, long before you could remember.\r\n</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><strong>Now you&#x27;re caught between order and the one who breaks it.\r\n</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><strong>Some choices were never yours to make.\r\n</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><strong>Some have been waiting for you longer than you’ve been alive.\r\n</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><strong>But maybe, if you try hard enough, you can still change something before it breaks you the same way it always does.</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><br></p>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-center\">CHARACTERS</h1>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI2ODI2MTQ5LnBuZw==/original/jv5XDc.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI2ODI2MTUzLnBuZw==/original/mLMFnW.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h3>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI2ODI2MTU4LnBuZw==/original/IF%2ByFr.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h3>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-center\">WARNING</h1>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><strong>Recommended for players aged 18+.</strong>\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">This game contains mature and potentially distressing content. Please be advised that it explores themes such as psychological struggles, bullying, supernatural elements, graphic violence, obsession, and death.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIzOTc5Mjg4LnBuZw==/original/jxt0lO.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h3>\r\n</h3>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">FEATURES</h2>\r\n<p><strong>✦&nbsp;2 Chapters</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>✦ Named MC (can be changed)\r\n</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>✦ Two gender options (She/Her, He/Him)\r\n</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>✦ 2 Love Interests</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>✦ SFW only</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>✦2&nbsp;Mini Games</strong></p>\r\n<p><em>NSFW and extended chapters are in development.</em><strong></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">✦✦</p>\r\n<p>Outdoors background from <a href=\"https://noranekogames.itch.io/yumebackground\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;Noraneko Games&quot;</a><span></span></p>\r\n<p>Background sounds and SFX -&nbsp; <a href=\"https://pixabay.com/\" target=\"_blank\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Pixabay</a>, <a href=\"https://orangefreesounds.com/\" target=\"_blank\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Orange Free Sounds</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Text/Dialogue Bleeps -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://dmochas-assets.itch.io/dmochas-bleeps-pack\" target=\"_blank\">dmochas</a></p>\r\n<p>Background music-&nbsp; Constellations and Earl Grey by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.chosic.com/free-music/lofi/?mixtag=dreamy\" target=\"_blank\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Purrple Cat</a><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">✦✦✦<br></p>\r\n<p>Hello \uD83D\uDC4B\uD83C\uDFFB, I&#x27;m the programmer who developed the game. I hope you&#x27;ll be satisfied and have a great time. If you encounter any bugs, please leave a comment. This will help improve the game, and everything will be fixed lightning-fast️.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Hi, I&#x27;m the designer, writer and artist for Witch&#x27;s Bound. I hope you enjoy exploring this world as much as I’ve enjoyed bringing it to life. The continuation will be even better. I promise. Thank you for being part of this.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIzOTc5MjgzLnBuZw==/original/l6AugX.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@danyxhz\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img title=\"tiktok\" alt=\"tiktok\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIzOTc3NjUyLnBuZw==/original/E0%2BgYs.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://patreon.com/Purpleproduction?utm_medium=unknown&utm_source=joi